% holding-blocked: The original is fully notated with words on every note, and the listening link is Lusafrica's official upload of the 1992 recording, but it has not been tried with students. A Grade 1 classroom teacher must trial the slow tempo, the breath after every second bar and the detached and accented notes; a Cabo Verdean music educator must review the morna, Kriolu and migration context and confirm the retitling away from "Sodade"; a second score reader must check the notes, words and cues.
